{
    "title": "OnStar Guardian: Safety App",
    "description": "SAFETY SERVICES RIGHT ON YOUR PHONE\r\n\u00a0\r\nGet family safety services \u2014 Roadside Assistance, help in a crash, family locator and Emergency Services \u2014 with the OnStar Guardian\u00ae\u00a0app. No matter where you are, we're with you and your family \u2013 in any vehicle, even on your motorcycle. Eligible OnStar Members receive the OnStar Guardian app as part of their plan. A standalone plan is only $15 a month. Plus, you can share the app with up to 7 friends or family members at no additional cost.\r\n\u00a0\r\nFAMILY SAFETY THAT GOES WHERE YOU GO\r\n\u00a0\r\nMobile Crash Response\r\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Crash detection that can send for help automatically\r\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Smartphone sensors can detect a car accident and alert an OnStar Advisor\r\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Help in a crash in any vehicle \u2014 or on your motorcycle\r\n\u00a0\r\nRoadside Assistance\r\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Don't get stranded. Get help on the road, jump a dead battery, get assistance with a flat tire \u2014 you can even get fuel delivered or request a tow\r\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Roadside Assistance for any vehicle or motorcycle\r\n\u00a0\r\nLocation Status\r\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Togetherness when you're apart. The family locator that lets you share and save real-time locations, view a live map, even send departure and arrival notifications\r\n\u00a0\r\nEmergency Services\r\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Help when it's needed. The red Emergency button provides priority access to an OnStar Emergency Advisor 24/7\r\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Get specially trained assistance with medical issues, severe weather and more \u2014 all while our Advisors send First Responders to your exact location\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\n\r\nLIMITATIONS\r\n\u00a0\r\nPrice subject to taxes and fees. See onstar.com/plans/guardian-app for details and limitations.\r\n\r\nU.S. and Canada only. Available on select Android devices. OnStar Guardian service plan, cell reception, GPS signal and device data connection required. May not transmit all crash data. You may cancel at any time by calling 1.888.4ONSTAR (1.888.466.7827).\r\n\r\nLocation Status services designed to locate compatible smartphones with Location Services permission enabled. Functionality varies by mobile device and plan. Data rates may apply. Terms and limitations apply.\r\n\r\nRoadside services provided by third-party providers. Roadside services are for passenger vehicles (cars and trucks) and motorcycles only. Limitations and restrictions apply. Towing services can be used four times per year then additional charges apply.\u00a0Additional charges apply to tire changes when a spare tire is not provided.\u00a0\u00a0\r\n\r\nUp to seven additional individuals can be added to the \u201cMy Family\u201d section within the app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "SAFETY SERVICES RIGHT ON YOUR PHONE<br>\u00a0<br>Get family safety services \u2014 Roadside Assistance, help in a crash, family locator and Emergency Services \u2014 with the OnStar Guardian\u00ae\u00a0app. No matter where you are, we&#39;re with you and your family \u2013 in any vehicle, even on your motorcycle. Eligible OnStar Members receive the OnStar Guardian app as part of their plan. A standalone plan is only $15 a month. Plus, you can share the app with up to 7 friends or family members at no additional cost.<br>\u00a0<br>FAMILY SAFETY THAT GOES WHERE YOU GO<br>\u00a0<br>Mobile Crash Response<br>\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Crash detection that can send for help automatically<br>\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Smartphone sensors can detect a car accident and alert an OnStar Advisor<br>\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Help in a crash in any vehicle \u2014 or on your motorcycle<br>\u00a0<br>Roadside Assistance<br>\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Don&#39;t get stranded. Get help on the road, jump a dead battery, get assistance with a flat tire \u2014 you can even get fuel delivered or request a tow<br>\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Roadside Assistance for any vehicle or motorcycle<br>\u00a0<br>Location Status<br>\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Togetherness when you&#39;re apart. The family locator that lets you share and save real-time locations, view a live map, even send departure and arrival notifications<br>\u00a0<br>Emergency Services<br>\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Help when it&#39;s needed. The red Emergency button provides priority access to an OnStar Emergency Advisor 24/7<br>\u2022\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Get specially trained assistance with medical issues, severe weather and more \u2014 all while our Advisors send First Responders to your exact location<br>\u00a0<br><br><br>LIMITATIONS<br>\u00a0<br>Price subject to taxes and fees. See onstar.com/plans/guardian-app for details and limitations.<br><br>U.S. and Canada only. Available on select Android devices. OnStar Guardian service plan, cell reception, GPS signal and device data connection required. May not transmit all crash data. You may cancel at any time by calling 1.888.4ONSTAR (1.888.466.7827).<br><br>Location Status services designed to locate compatible smartphones with Location Services permission enabled. Functionality varies by mobile device and plan. Data rates may apply. Terms and limitations apply.<br><br>Roadside services provided by third-party providers. Roadside services are for passenger vehicles (cars and trucks) and motorcycles only. Limitations and restrictions apply. Towing services can be used four times per year then additional charges apply.\u00a0Additional charges apply to tire changes when a spare tire is not provided.\u00a0\u00a0<br><br>Up to seven additional individuals can be added to the \u201cMy Family\u201d section within the app.",
